eptance at this cycle count needs over 78.663 MHz.\\nKeeping the product in a separate register lets the implementer tune the\\nconsumer mux without placing a product select after the ordinary ALU.\\nSelftest and all three random programs matched the reference retirement\\ntrace with both buses stalling.\\n', 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 1, 'confidence': 'medium'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/ex_stage.sv'\n…[3098 of 6170 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b9c84bf55c30f203]…\nuse interlocks.\\n'}], 'outcome': 'improvement', 'fitness': 258.94, 'delta_pct': 5.45, 'vs_baseline': 2036.47, 'fmax_mhz': 79.301, 'ipc_coremark': 3e-06, 'cycles': 3062533, 'iterations': 10, 'lut4': 3615, 'ff': 837, 'seeds': [72.196, 79.301, 79.301], 'perturbations': [[0, 72.196, 14], [1, 79.301, 16], [2, 79.301, 16]], 'lutram': 36, 'bsram': 13, 'dsp': 4, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_if/response_q.instr_response_q.instr_0_0_s', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/pc_q_31_s1', 'slack_ns': -8.851, 'arrival_ns': 19.146, 'logic_cells': 22, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_id', 'cpu/u_if']}, 'logic_levels': 14, 'formal_passed': True, 'cosim_passed': True, 'error': None, 'implementation_notes': '', 'timestamp': '2026-11-21T00:35:14.431256Z', 'slot': 0, 'round_id': 9, 'lesson': '- 2026-11-21 hyp-20261121-001-r9s0 (improvement, +5.45%): A dedicated EX multiplier removed the divider seed ROM from the multiply writeback path, and a one-hot bypass selected in decode let the next instruction use the registered product without a stall.'}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
