{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The Gowin report shows that the champion’s RAM-address path crosses a multiplier DSP. A dedicated address adder removes that path, but its measured median reaches only 50.621 MHz, below the 52.03 MHz needed at the current cycle count. I’ll check whether retaining a fetch during a decode stall can recover enough cycles to clear the margin."}}
