{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"agent_message","text":"Wrote and schema-validated [hyp-20261120-001-r4s0.yaml](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_2-astra_xhigh-v2-rep3/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261120-001-r4s0-hypgen/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261120-001-r4s0.yaml). The proposal forwards completed loads directly to dependent RV32I instructions while keeping the multiplier off the live RAM-data path.\n\nThe isolated prototype reached **126.39 CoreMark iterations/s**, 6.59% above the champion and beyond the 4.6% acceptance margin. It saved 204,397 bracketed cycles over ten iterations at a median Fmax of 50.429 MHz. All five CoreMark CRCs matched, and all 53 fast formal checks and 89 cocotb cases passed."}}
