ives\n  205.12 iterations/s, 17.63% above the champion. The worst path in each\n  placement now runs from the divider seed ROM to its quotient register.\n  The prototype uses 3,375 logic cells and seven block RAMs, compared with\n  3,268 and nine for the champion. All four RVFI cosim programs matched\n  the reference on ready and s\n…[1359 of 4431 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:485c6ef43cb6e0bf]…\nch source, mask the three candidate values with\n      the registered selector and OR them into the operand used for all\n      EX operations, store data and the RVFI source snapshot.\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: |\n      Expose the write permission after the memory alignment check for\n      ID's older-producer match. Preserve the MEM/WB forwarding payload\n      when a data-bus wait clears its retirement valid bit.\n  - file: test/test_reg_file.py\n    description: |\n      Write distinct nonzero words to x5 and x21, reset again, and\n      check both read ports return zero. Write x21 and check x5 still\n      reads zero.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Check that both sources select the younger of two writers to x5.\n      Follow a misaligned load and a misaligned JALR with consumers of\n      their suppressed destinations. Hold a consumer behind a waiting\n      load while its other source retires. Check source values, order,\n      traps and the single accepted dependent store.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
