{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"The proposed predictor steers fetch for direct branches and JAL, then uses a one-bit decision in EX to recover on a miss. The [hypothesis YAML](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_2-astra_xhigh-v2-rep3/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261120-003-r3s2-hypgen/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261120-003-r3s2.yaml) passes schema validation.\n\nAn isolated prototype reached **114.06 CoreMark iterations/s**, **9.35% above** the 104.30 champion, clearing the 4.6% acceptance margin. It saved 297,051 bracketed cycles across ten iterations at a median Gowin Fmax of 47.840 MHz. All five CoreMark CRCs matched, and all 53 fast formal checks passed."}}
