e address for\n      memory operations. Match the candidate and extract the load value\n      in parallel. Select the extracted value into EX/MEM.alu_result for\n      a load. Only a verified hit releases the load-use interlock, so a\n      miss's speculative value cannot reach a dependent instruction.\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: |\n      Drive the bus address, trap checks and byte masks from the registered\n      effective address. Suppress the demand read on an early hit, use its\n      registered extended value for WB and its saved raw word for RVFI.\n      Supply the ordinary bus read and extension on a miss.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Test a repeating load with an older producer updating its base,\n      then change the producer displacement. Cover PC and data-index\n      aliases, same-row read/write, a stalled partial store, subword sign\n      extension and misalignment. Check hit and miss retirement spacing,\n      RVFI data and masks, and external read counts under backpressure.\nYAML\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
