{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_81","type":"agent_message","text":"A prototype that predicts load latency and forwards the previously formatted result reached 194.84 iterations/s across three Gowin placements. All five CoreMark CRCs matched. I’ll check miss recovery under stalls and measure how much the scheduling prediction contributes on its own."}}
