e edge. In EX, mask and OR the captured operand, EX/MEM ALU\\nresult and MEM/WB write data. Each bypass still delivers its value at the\\noriginal clock. Moving the read and priority decision before the edge\\nshortens the path through EX for memory, arithmetic and branch consumers.\\n\\nAn isolated prototype reached 66.872, 67.927 and 67.927 MHz under the\\nthree Gowin placement options.\n…[49781 of 52853 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:22146faae627148e]…\n', 'fitness': 231.11, 'delta_pct': 11.97, 'vs_baseline': 1806.85, 'fmax_mhz': 71.595, 'ipc_coremark': 3e-06, 'cycles': 3097817, 'iterations': 10, 'lut4': 3691, 'ff': 807, 'seeds': [69.544, 71.595, 71.595], 'perturbations': [[0, 69.544, 10], [1, 71.595, 10], [2, 71.595, 10]], 'lutram': 36, 'bsram': 13, 'dsp': 2, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu/seed_seed_0_0_s', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu/quotient_q_8_s0', 'slack_ns': -9.379, 'arrival_ns': 19.674, 'logic_cells': 10, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu']}, 'logic_levels': 10, 'formal_passed': True, 'cosim_passed': True, 'error': None, 'implementation_notes': '', 'timestamp': '2026-11-20T22:57:08.120327Z', 'slot': 2, 'round_id': 7, 'lesson': \"- 2026-11-21 hyp-20261120-003-r7s2 (improvement, +11.97%): Using a pending load's unchecked word to predict the next buffer index lets pointer-chasing loads probe on consecutive cycles, while EX verifies the full word address before forwarding and probes the resolved index so a wrong guess can still hit in MEM.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
