ta-RAM\\\\npath at 25.402 ns and a divider feedback path at 25.399 ns. Moving\\\\nmultiplication to MEM alone raised the median from 49.733 to 50.165 MHz,\\\\n', 'Share one registered multiplier across all eight RV32M operations')\n('hyp-20261120-002-r5s1', None, '{\\'motivation\\': \"The champion takes 3,408,562 cycles for ten iterations at 48.072 MHz.\\\\nGowin reports a 27.067 ns path from the register file through the EX ALU\\\\nto data RAM. The five-step divider feedback path reached 25.389 ns on', 'Pipeline RV32M products through MEM and reuse the multiplier for division')\n('hyp-20261120-002-r6s1', None, \"{'motivation': 'The champion runs ten CoreMark iterations in 3,444,219 cycles at\\\\n60.061 MHz. All 25 setup paths in the placement-0 timing report start\\\\nat a register-file block RAM output. The worst passes through operand\\\\nforwar\", 'Collect register operands and select their forwarding sources in decode')\n('hyp-20261120-002-r7s1', None, '{\\'motivation\\': \"Gowin traced the champion\\'s 19.855 ns worst path from the reciprocal\\\\nseed ROM to the quotient register. The other round-six operand design\\\\nhad the same endpoints. Four kinds of divider product and ordinary MUL\\\\na', 'Give Newton division dedicated registered product paths')\n('hyp-20261121-002-r8s1', None, '{\\'motivation\\': \"The champion takes 3,097,817 cycles for ten CoreMark iterations. Its\\\\nreported 19.674 ns worst path runs from the Newton seed ROM to the quotient\\\\nregister. The timed loop executes no divides, so that feedback path', 'Compute exact RV32M division with a linear reciprocal table and two dividend guard bits')\n('hyp-20261121-002-r9s1', None, \"{'motivation': 'The champion runs ten iterations in 3,097,817 cycles. Repeating Gowin\\\\nplacement 1 reproduced its 76.071 MHz median. The first setup path runs\\\\nfrom the reciprocal seed ROM through the shared DSP to MEM/WB write_da\", 'Select physical writeback banks when decode issues each consumer')\n('hyp-20261121-002-r10s1', None, \"{'motivation': 'The champion retires 2,922,016 instructions in 3,062,533 timed cycles.\\\\nEven perfect single-channel retirement could gain only 4.81% at the\\\\nsame clock. Gowin placement 1 reproduced 79.301 MHz and traced its\\\\nworst\", 'Issue instructions from registered four-word fetch blocks')\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
