 quotient, and one computes Q*B for exact correction. While the\\nreciprocal refines, pre-shift dividend magnitude A by the divisor\\nexponent k and precompute A-B. The quotient product then feeds a fixed\\nbit slice. The residual product feeds two parallel subtractors whose\\nregistered outputs supply both possible remainders and the correction\\nbit. This keeps the seven divide clocks and one multiply issue per clock.\\n\\nFor n\n…[8544 of 11616 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:9654b2ec83f065b8]…\natural alignment before\\ncompleting a load internally. Drive the existing hazard inputs\\nfrom load-without-early-hit or multiply in EX, and demand-load or store\\nin MEM. Keep ordinary store and MMIO handshake ordering. Select the\\nresolved raw word on an internal hit and the bus word on demand.\\nGate the external read strobe with the resolved miss.\\n\"}, {'file': 'rtl/ex_stage.sv', 'description': 'Expose forwarded rs1 plus immediate for the resolved RAM index and\\nlatch the full address in EX/MEM. Format the early raw word using\\nthe actual low address bits, width and signedness. Route that candidate\\nthrough the EX/MEM ALU-result slot for loads. The interlock ensures\\nonly a verified early value can reach an architectural consumer.\\n'}, {'file': 'rtl/core_pkg.sv', 'description': \"Add the full resolved memory address to ex_mem_t so the early\\nforwarding result and the load's real address can travel together.\\n\"}, {'file': 'rtl/mem_stage.sv', 'description': 'Use the separate resolved address for bus addressing\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
