        // Channel 0 — the only retirement channel. With nret=1 in\n48:        // slicing. No `_1` ports exist on the core's IO under nret=1.\n50:        .io_rvfi_order_0    (rvfi_order),\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
